      "en": "“Two men went up into the temple to pray; one was a Pharisee, and the other was a tax collector.",
      "ko": "두 사람이 기도하러 성전에 올라가니 하나는 바리새인이요 하나는 세리라",
      "source_text_hash": "e8cca485f6e3d64c633ca33169391c57c3768113577406ce615afe8ba8525b87",
      "translation_text_hash": "10404ae290fd86229403961439f8d5481d0a56c9cd6d83aa30a44fc14d6e275a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
